<div id="fringe">
<div class="oas_info"><p>The Ocean Archive System searches our original datasets as they were submitted to us, not individual points or profiles. If you want to search and retrieve ocean profiles in a common format, or objectively analyzed fields, your better option may be to use one of our project applications. See: <a href="http://www.ncei.noaa.gov/access">Access Data</a></p></div>
<div class="title">
<h5>OAS: Download accessions</h5>
</div>
<div id="controlbar">
<ul>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="oas_container">
<p><strong>Bulk downloads are limited to no more than 2000 MB per attempt.</strong></p>
<ol>
<li>
<p><strong><a href="/data/oceans/archive/arc0001/0001363/">Download individual files for accession: 1363</a> (directory view)</strong>, 
or download the complete archive bundle below.</p>
<p><i>(Current version has the highest version number.)</i></p>
<ol>
<li>
<a href="/archive/archive-management-system/OAS/bin/prd/jquery/download/1363.1.1.tar.gz">1363.1.1.tar.gz</a> ~ (97.212 MB)</li>
<li>
<a href="/archive/archive-management-system/OAS/bin/prd/jquery/download/1363.2.2.tar.gz">1363.2.2.tar.gz</a> ~ (97.632 MB)<strong class="err"><i>* Most recent published version</i></strong>
</li>
</ol>
</li>
</ol>
<p>For further assistance accessing archive data, please contact: <a href="http://www.ncei.noaa.gov/contact">Customer Service</a></p>
</div>
